            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[- Scheduled backups keep running while the disk is ejected: when a backup is due on Time Machine's schedule, the disk is mounted, backed up, and ejected again
- The menu shows when the latest backup was
- The menu bar icon is now a disk and gets a Time Machine badge while a backup is running, so you can tell when not to unplug it
]]></description>
